olled title and no roll chevron: the title bar shows the name only.\nDouble-clicking the title and the fence menu still roll the fence up and down.","type":"boolean"},"hideInactiveScrollbar":{"default":false,"description":"Show the scrollbar only while the mouse is inside the fence or right after scrolling.","type":"boolean"},"hoverPeek":{"default":true,"type":"boolean"},"hoverSpeed":{"$ref":"#/$defs/HoverSpeed","default":"normal","description":"How long the pointer (or a dragged file) rests on a rolled fence before it expands, and\non a tab before `switch_tab_on_hover` switches to it: `normal` is Windows' mouse hover\ntime (feedback #98)."},"pushNeighbors":{"default":true,"description":"While a fence is expanded (a click or a hover peek), the fences stacked below it slide down\nout of its way and slide back when it rolls up. The saved positions stay where they were.","type":"boolean"},"switchTabOnHover":{"default":true,"description":"Resting the pointer on a tab of a tabbed fence for the hover delay switches to it, as a\nclick would. On by default; a configuration that already says `false` keeps it.","type":"boolean"},"titleOnHover":{"default":false,"description":"Draw the title (and tabs) only while the mouse is over the fence; a fence's\n`appearance.titleOnHover` overrides it.","type":"boolean"}},"type":"object"},"Rule":{"properties":{"allOf":{"description":"All conditions must hold (AND).","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Cond"},"type":"array"},"enabled":{"type":"boolean"},"id":{"format":"uuid","type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"priorityClass":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Class"},"target":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Target"},"template":{"description":"The \"快速添加\" template this rule came from (see [`Template::key`]), so the template\nis offered once even after the user renames the rule.","type":["string","null"]}},"required":["id","name","enabled","target","allOf","priorityClass"],"type":"object"},"RuleSet":{"properties":{"defaultTarget":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Target"},"keepUpdated":{"type"