d help right now (收起 after\nthe 4th fence, 在桌面显示此文件夹 for a folder opened often, a rule for files of one\ntype dragged into one fence). Off shows none of them; the first start's tips stay.","type":"boolean"},"hideInboxWhenIconsShown":{"default":false,"description":"While `hideRealIcons` is off, the inbox fence has no window: the items no rule files\nshow only among Windows' own desktop icons.","type":"boolean"},"hideRealIcons":{"type":"boolean"},"iconSize":{"description":"Icon size of new fences, in DIPs: 24 to 128 in steps of 4.","format":"uint32","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"icons":{"$ref":"#/$defs/IconSettings","default":{"chameleon":false,"shortcutArrows":true,"tintRgb":null,"tintStrength":0.6000000238418579}},"keepIconsHidden":{"default":false,"description":"With `hideRealIcons`, Windows' desktop icons stay hidden when PecoFence exits or the\nsession ends, so they do not show for a moment at the next sign-in before PecoFence\nstarts. A crash still shows them.","type":"boolean"},"labelColor":{"$ref":"#/$defs/LabelColor","default":"auto","description":"Colour of the item names in every fence; fence titles have their own `titleColor`."},"language":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Language","default":"zh-CN"},"mirrorFencesAcrossMonitors":{"default":true,"description":"Show a live view of every fence on each other connected display.","type":"boolean"},"offerNewFence":{"default":true,"description":"A rectangle drawn on the empty desktop that touches no fence shows the 「新建栅栏」 and\n「在此显示文件夹…」 buttons at its corner.","type":"boolean"},"peek":{"$ref":"#/$defs/PeekSettings","default":{"customHotkey":null,"dim":true,"doubleCtrl":false,"enabled":true,"hotkey":"ctrlAltSpace"},"description":"Fences \"Peek\": a hotkey floats every fence above the current windows."},"perDesktopFences":{"default":false,"description":"每个虚拟桌面各用一套栅栏: a new fence shows only on the Windows virtual desktop it is made\non (its `virtualDesktops`); off, new fences show on every desktop. Fences that exist keep\ntheir own choice either way.","type":"boolean"},"quickHide":{"$ref":"#/$defs/QuickHideSettings"},"rollUp":{"$ref":"#/$defs/RollUpSettings"},"showDesktop":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ShowDesktopSetting"},"showTrayIcon":{"default":true,"description":"显示托盘图标: PecoFence's icon in the taskbar's notification area. Off keeps it out,\nexcept for the seconds a notification of PecoFence shows, while the item menus wait\nto get their Windows part back after a crash (the entry is in the icon's menu), and\nwhile none of Peek's shortcuts can be registered (速览所有栅栏 is in that menu).","type":"boolean"},"snapping":{"$ref":"#/$defs/SnappingSettings"},"tabBar":{"$ref":"#/$defs/TabBar","default":"top","description":"Where a fence with two or more tabs shows them."},"theme":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ThemeSetting"},"themeStyle":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ThemeStyle","default":"fluent","description":"Material style is independent of the light/dark preference."},"titleAlign":{"$ref":"#/$defs/TitleAlign","default":"left","description":"Where every fence's title (or tab strip) sits in its title row."},"tools":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ToolSettings","default":{"clockSeconds":false,"dialogJump":false,"enabled":true,"everything":false},"description":"小工具: which tools are switched on. A tool that is off runs nothing, and its fences\nhave no window until it is switched on again."},"usageStats":{"default":true,"description":"发送使用统计: which features are used and in which order, with the version, the Windows\nversion and a random install number (`usage.rs`). No names, paths or typed text.","type":"boolean"},"windowsDesktopHotkey":{"default":null,"description":"「临时显示 Windows 桌面」: a shortcut, written like `peek.customHotkey` (\"Ctrl+Alt+D\"),\nthat hides every fence and shows the Windows desktop icons PecoFence hid, until it is\npressed again. Nothing of that is saved. `null` (the default) = no shortcut; the tray\nmenu and `pecofence-cli windows-desktop` still switch. Text that is not a usable\nshortcut is ignored the same way.","type":["string","nu